/-!
# Natural-module recognition for the original exchanged component

The original Q1 offender excludes all nonnatural B.5 alternatives on the
literal component. Natural coordinates intertwine the original quotient
action on [U,L], give the direct splitting U = [U,L] C_U(L), and identify the
nonzero projected seed and its stabilizer ML. Both source plane sizes are
retained throughout recognition. The source-row application then forces
the four-element-plane row using faithful seed projection.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith 15.1.27--28, printed pp.1102--1103.
-/
